## INTEGRATION ISSUES

---

**Issue Title:** Thrive Portal Status Not Syncing After Customer Signs Documents
**Category:** Integration Issues
**Description:** After a customer signs documents on Thrive's portal, the status on the Portal 2.0 side does not automatically update to reflect the completion. Reps cannot confirm the customer has finished their steps without manual status checks.
